    "scenesThatPass": [
      "YOUNG RAYA: I have something to say...\nYOUNG RAYA: Who’s hungry?\nVIRANA: Go ahead. It’s alright.\nYOUNG NAMAARI: I’m Namaari. Of Fang.",
      "YOUNG RAYA: Seriously? Your mom actually said that? Awkward.\nYOUNG RAYA: Okay, next question - hand-to-hand or swords?\nYOUNG NAMAARI: Blades all day.\nYOUNG RAYA: Right?",
      "YOUNG NAMAARI: The spirit of Sisu. I can feel it.\nYOUNG RAYA: It’s the last bit of dragon magic left in the whole world.\nYOUNG NAMAARI: I see why Heart guards it so closely. Thank you, dep la. You’ve been very helpful.\nYOUNG NAMAARI: In a different world, maybe we coulda been friends. But I have to do what’s right for Fang.",
      "YOUNG RAYA: There is no way you’re taking Sisu’s Gem.\nYOUNG NAMAARI: Sorry. It’s Fang’s now.",
      "RAYA: Sisudatu... I don’t know if you’re listening. I’ve searched every river to find you. And now I’m here at the very last one. Look, there’s no…\nRAYA: Okay. Here goes everything.\nRAYA: Suva de dra sim Mandra de dra lim Bavaa de dra Tomben.\nRAYA: I know, buddy, I haven’t forgot -"
    ]
  },
